# Scoped to the Python venv's own lib/ dir, not frontend/src/lib/ — the
# unscoped "lib/" pattern below used to match ANY lib/ directory anywhere in
# the repo (including frontend/src/lib/), silently blocking new files added
# there from ever being `git add`-able without -f. Found while adding
# frontend/src/lib/return-url.ts.
